WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
There aren't many people in the store in the afternoon, so there's no need to go to work.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:10,700
What's the matter with just a full day's salary? If anything happens, just ask Brother Lin.

3
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:13,980
Can I know first how many days my salary will be?

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,960
That's all

5
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:17,900
Look at your expression

6
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,960
I thought you wanted me to meet my daughter like this

7
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:25,510
I'll give you this half month's salary and bonus together. If it's not enough, tell me again.

8
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:27,670
Thank you boss

9
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:33,130
We have known each other for such a long time. I am older than you. From now on, I will call you Lin Ge.

10
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:41,780
He's really here again
